========= 3D Traffic Simulator Controls =========
CAMERA MODES:
  1           - Free camera mode (default)
  2           - Follow car camera
  3           - Follow pedestrian camera
  4           - Building view (bird's eye)
  N / M       - Switch target (in follow modes)

FREE CAMERA MOVEMENT:
  W/A/S/D     - Move forward/left/backward/right
  Arrow Keys  - Look around (pitch/yaw)
  E/C         - Move up/down
  + / -       - Increase/decrease movement speed

DAY/NIGHT & WEATHER:
  T           - Toggle day/night cycle on/off
  L           - Clear weather
  P           - Rain
  O           - Snow

TRAFFIC DENSITY:
  0           - Minimal traffic (1)
  7           - Low traffic (5)
  8           - Medium traffic (10, default)
  9           - High traffic (20)
  5 / 6       - Decrease/Increase density

SIMULATION:
  SPACE       - Toggle auto-rotation
  R           - Reset simulation and camera
  Q / ESC     - Quit
